    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Behan Irwin & Gosling are delighted to present 4 Church Hill, Carrigaline, Co. Cork, P43 YV22 to the market. This attractive end-of-terrace home enjoys an excellent location within walking distance of a wide range of local amenities, including primary and secondary schools, doctor's surgery, pharmacy, supermarkets, bars, restaurants, church and regular bus services. The property also benefits from easy access to Cork City, Ringaskiddy, a selection of beautiful local beaches and all major road networks.\r\nIdeal for first-time buyers, investors or those seeking a conveniently located family home, the accommodation is bright, spacious and well laid out.\r\nThis superb home combines a highly convenient location with comfortable, light-filled accommodation, making it an excellent opportunity for a wide range of purchasers.\r\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with the sole selling agents, Behan Irwin & Gosling."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance / Hallway (4.40m x 1.85m)\r\nSolid teak front door with frosted glass insert leading to hallway with  laminate wood floor, radiator, two power points, phone point, centre light.\r\n\r\nOpen plan Kitchen / Living / Dining Room  (7.42m x 4.95m)\r\nKitchen Area\r\nFully fitted kitchen with floor and eye level units, single drainer stainless steel sink, tile splash back, integrated induction hob and electric oven, washing machine, dishwasher,  Wiesmann gas boiler, window with venetian blinds facing front of property, built in extractor hood, fridge freezer, laminate wood floors, radiator, recessed lighting.\r\nLiving / Dining  Room Area\r\nLaminate wood floors, radiator, recessed lighting, window, sliding patio door to back patio area, four power points.\r\n\r\nGuest WC (1.57m x 0.73m)\r\nWC, WHB, vinyl floor covering, wall attach mirror, centre light and extractor fan. \r\n\r\nStairs to Landing\r\nFully carpeted, acce4ss to attic from the landing, shelved hot press.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom (1.97m x 1.83m)\r\nWC, WHB, bath with electric shower and shower door over, tile splash back, centre light, window with blind and frosted glass insert, radiator.\r\n\r\nMain Bedroom (3.80m x 2.85m)\r\nCarpet floor covering, window, radiator, centre light, six power points, TV point.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (3.54m x 2.85m)\r\nCarpet floor covering, window, velux window, radiator, centre light, two power points.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (2.36m x 1.95m)\r\nCarpet floor covering, window, velux window, radiator, two power points, centre light.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nTo the front - side access, side gate, parking is on street.\r\nTo the back - a patio area."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "3 bedroom end of terrace property.\r\nWithin walking distance of all local amenities.\r\nWest facing back garden incorporating patio area to allow the benefit of evening summer sun.\r\nGas central heating and PVC double glazed windows throughout."
      },
      {
